<td id="A2.T7.3.9.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">
<span id="A2.T7.3.9.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A2.T7.3.9.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">¡/blink¿</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T7.3.10" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A2.T7.3.10.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">
<span id="A2.T7.3.10.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A2.T7.3.10.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">¡think¿ reasoning process here ¡/think¿</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T7.3.11" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A2.T7.3.11.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">
<span id="A2.T7.3.11.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A2.T7.3.11.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">¡link¿ answer([”Plan”: …, ”Action”: ”function”: …, …]) ¡/link¿.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T7.3.12" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A2.T7.3.12.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">
<span id="A2.T7.3.12.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A2.T7.3.12.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">where captions must be one of [dynamic, static], ”dynamic” refers to the interactive area, and ”static” refers to the non-interactive areas, such as text and diagrams in the screenshot.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T7.3.13" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A2.T7.3.13.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">
<span id="A2.T7.3.13.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A2.T7.3.13.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">And the observation can be ¡blink¿ None ¡/blink¿, if <math id="A2.T7.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>N</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N</annotation></semantics></math> == 0.</span>
</span></td></tr>
